<p>Hi {{ name }},</p>
{{#if isCostBudget}}
<p>
  Project <strong>{{ projectName }}</strong> has reached its cost budget.
</p>
<p>Burned: <strong>${{ burnedCost }}</strong> of <strong>${{ budgetAmount }}</strong></p>
{{else}}
<p>
  Project <strong>{{ projectName }}</strong> has reached its budget
  ({{ burnedHours }}h of {{ budgetHours }}h).
</p>
{{/if}}
{{#if isStopped}}
<p><strong>Tracking has been stopped for team members.</strong></p>
{{else}}
<p>Tracking is still allowed (Alert Only mode).</p>
{{/if}}
<p><a href="{{ appUrl }}">Review in Timemoz →</a></p>
